--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/add-enabled-parameter-4c1e0b7d9a2f6e35.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+---
+features:
+  - |
+    Added an ``enabled`` parameter (default ``True``) to ``Retrying``,
+    ``AsyncRetrying`` and the ``@retry`` decorator. With ``enabled=False`` the
+    decorated function is called exactly once, with no retry logic, and any
+    exception it raises propagates unchanged. This is useful during development
+    and testing.
